//RS /// `[PluginValue]` argument list `params_wire`. Returns `"O:"` + the
//RS /// wire-encoded `PluginValue` result, or `"E:<kind>:<message>"` retaining the
//RS /// Jet operation and exported call boundary. Kinds distinguish user error,
//RS /// denied authority, budget exhaustion, and internal host defect. Every path
//RS /// is a `Result`; nothing here can panic the host program (I2).
//RS pub fn jet_plugin_call(handle: u64, name: &str, params_wire: &str) -> String {
